      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The way to get a Sorcerer registration ticket is really simple. You just need to go and find one of each spirit scattered around the world, and then convert their power into the shape of a certain material.",
      "translation" : "拿到妖術師登記證明的方法很簡單。你只要去尋找散佈在世界各地的精靈各一隻，再把它們的力量轉化成特定形態的材料就行了。"
