      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Usually we cannot see the spirits with our eyes but there is a way to realize the part of the spirits through a special medium.",
      "translation" : "通常我們無法用肉眼看見精靈，但藉助特殊媒介，就能感知到精靈的一部分。"
