      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We have set up the detecting poles in these 4 places so that ordinary people can communicate with the spirits.",
      "translation" : "我們在這4個地點設定了探測法杖，讓普通人也能與精靈溝通。"
