      "npc" : "Karacas",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Be aware that these detecting poles are activated only when you have more than the certain amount of property stones.",
      "translation" : "請注意，只有攜帶足夠數量的屬性石，探測法杖才會啟動。"
